      "critical_source_limits": [
        "MAP renal thresholds use conflicting units and thresholds; no silent conversion or numeric methotrexate/rescue prescription.",
        "MAP rescue is never held because chemotherapy count gates fail; source rescue thresholds and timing conflicts remain urgent specialist decisions.",
        "00100 fixed source premedication examples are not automatic paediatric doses; keep routine steroids out of generic support.",
        "00100 legacy negative resection flag is hidden but preserves its prior truth contract; visible positive control has explicit conflict handling.",
        "00596/00680 neurological histories and schedules are different; no algorithm transfer.",
        "00596b does not state a relapse qualifier;00680b does, and has a detailed-eligibility gap."
      ],
